# Copy to deploy/.env and adjust. Everything else is configured in the web UI.

# Required: LAN IP of this host. The UI and the agent API listen only on this address.
LABLANTERN_BIND_IP=192.168.1.50

# Required: names and IPs under which browsers and agents reach this host. The proxy issues certificates
# only for these. Passkeys need a name (not an IP): add e.g. lablantern.lan and point it to this host in your DNS.
LABLANTERN_HOSTNAMES=lablantern.lan,192.168.1.50

# Optional: HTTPS port (default 8443).
# LABLANTERN_PORT=8443

# Optional: scanners. grype+osv (default) uses two sources. grype is the light mode: OSV is switched off and needs
# no memory for its databases. Recreate the worker after a change (no run may be active).
# LABLANTERN_SCANNERS=grype+osv

# Optional: image tag, so a second stack (e.g. a test install) does not overwrite this one's images.
# LABLANTERN_TAG=dev

# Optional: internal network between proxy and server. Change only if it collides with a network in your LAN
# or with a second LabLantern stack on the same host.
# LABLANTERN_EDGE_SUBNET=10.89.254.0/29
# LABLANTERN_PROXY_IP=10.89.254.2
# LABLANTERN_SERVER_IP=10.89.254.3
